{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/faq.png?t=1743772080\" /><br><br><strong>MR DONALD is a satirical first-person adventure simulator in the spirit of the PSX era</strong>. Every day, the president faces his usual boring duties: endless meetings, pointless briefings, and the occasional rocket launch for Elon. But deep down, he\u2019s focused on what really matters \u2014 saving gamedev and America.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/signlaws_en.gif?t=1743772080\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/lawsgif_en.gif?t=1743772080\" /><br><br><strong>You\u2019re the head of state. Your job? </strong> Keep the country in order. Sign laws you deem reasonable and rewrite the rules as you see fit. But tread carefully \u2014 one wrong move and you might just plunge the nation into total chaos... \u201caccidentally,\u201d of course. A perfect chance to ban microtransactions in games, wouldn\u2019t you say?<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/dailyroutine.png?t=1743772080\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/dailyroutinegif.gif?t=1743772080\" /><br><br><strong>Every day, the President has to deal with a ton of boring tasks</strong> \u2014 from meeting other politicians to launching Elon into space. Try not to fall asleep from all the endless bureaucracy. Don\u2019t worry, we didn\u2019t forget the memes. You\u2019ll get to buy Canada, launch your own crypto coin, fry some potatoes, and so much more.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/wintheelections.png?t=1743772080\"